<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="b32b-2b78-118a-10a5" name="Orks (4th, HB)" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="3e14-94fd-04c7-0064" gameSystemRevision="25" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <comment>Mix of 3rd and 4th edition with priority on the fluffiest part of both lists (Mostly 3rd ED, 4th ED suffered from 5th ED streamlining). Also takes some homebrew from the 30k ork project for missing units. Some notes:
Waaagh &gt; 4th edition. (More in line with how orks work, with furious charge taking the place of the old Waaagh)
Mob Rule! &gt; Mixed. Fearless is easier to deal with than the extra rolling, but mobbing up was a core part of orks identity.</comment>
