      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="75f3-dc26-4e95-aec9" name="Might Makes Right" hidden="false">
          <description>Orks lead by being the biggest and strongest, and thus an army cannot include orks of higher &quot;rank&quot; than the boss itself. Thusly; an army led by a Big Boss cannot take Nobz or a Big Mek and an army NOT led by a Tyrant cannot take Brutes.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
