                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="16c1-9be0-ff19-a284" name="Bigbomm" hidden="false">
                      <description>Once per game, a Deffkopta with a Bigbomm may make a special attack, even if it has turbo boosted that turn. Place the large blast template with the central hole on  a model that the Deffkopta has passed over during its movement phase. The Bigbomm scatters D6&quot; and is resolved with Strength 4 and AP5.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                  <costs>
